    "body": "Problem:\r\nOne item with an edit range before the word boundary changes the start column for all items. For tsserver `str.`, completing `str.char` can become `strcharAt` and break filtering.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nPrepend the missing text and filter on it.\r\n\r\nFixes #41456\r\n\r\n\r\n",
